  "name": "Employee Performance Review",
  "description": "Run annual or mid-year reviews: competency ratings, goal results, strengths, development areas, next goals and sign-off.",
  "category": "HR & Recruiting",
  "seoTitle": "Free Employee Performance Review Form Template",
  "seoDescription": "Employee performance review form template with competency ratings, goal results, strengths, areas to improve, next-period goals and an overall rating.",
